{"unit_id": "tag:089U:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>表示（representing）函子（functor）<MATH_0003>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>上的格拉斯曼概形（Grassmannian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n它的基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>以概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>为新底，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0007>上的格拉斯曼概形（Grassmannian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。若<MATH_0008>是环（ring），则到<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）记作<MATH_0010>，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0011>上的格拉斯曼概形（Grassmannian）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示所给函子的概形。"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示", "context": "指概形表示给定函子。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "定义中由该概形表示的函子。"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形", "context": "对表示该函子的概形命名。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "将格拉斯曼概形变换到给定概形上。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基变换所得概形的底概形。"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形", "context": "对给定概形上的基变换命名。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指定以环为底时的记号。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "对环指定相应基变换的记号。"}, {"source_term": "Grassmannian", "target_term": "格拉斯曼概形", "context": "指在给定环上的格拉斯曼概形。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:089R:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个定义是有意义的，因为我们已在引理<REF_0001>中证明这些函子（functors）确实是可表的（representable）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指该定义所涉及的一族函子。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表的", "context": "指这些函子确实可由概形表示。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:089V:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。存在一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0002>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "描述引理所断言存在的同构。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:089V:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>表示（represents）如下函子（functor）：它将概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>对应到如下集合（set）：取偶对（pairs）<MATH_0003>的同构（isomorphisms）类（classes），其中每个偶对由一个可逆模（invertible module）<MATH_0004>和一个由<MATH_0005>个整体截面（global sections）构成的元组（-tuple）组成，这些截面生成<MATH_0006>。\n给定这样的偶对（pair），我们得到一个商（quotient）<MATH_0007>\n反之，若给定元素（element）<MATH_0008>，且它属于<MATH_0009>，我们便得到这样的偶对（pair），即<MATH_0010>。\n这里，<MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>是自由模（free module）<MATH_0013>的标准生成截面（generating sections）。\n我们略去对这些构造定义了互为逆（inverse）的函子（functors）变换（transformations）的验证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "偶对"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "classes", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "invertible module", "target_term": "可逆模"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "-tuple", "target_term": "元组"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "偶对"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "偶对"}, {"source_term": "free module", "target_term": "自由模"}, {"source_term": "generating sections", "target_term": "生成截面"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "transformations", "target_term": "变换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指表示该函子的概形。"}, {"source_term": "represents", "target_term": "表示", "context": "给出概形与函子的表示关系。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指由引理所给概形表示的函子。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指函子取值的输入对象。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指函子在给定概形上的取值。"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "偶对", "context": "取同构类的对象由可逆模与一组截面构成。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指定将偶对归类的关系。"}, {"source_term": "classes", "target_term": "类", "context": "按同构关系对偶对分类所得的类。"}, {"source_term": "invertible module", "target_term": "可逆模", "context": "指构成偶对的模。"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面", "context": "这些截面组成元组并生成给定模。"}, {"source_term": "-tuple", "target_term": "元组", "context": "指具有指定长度的截面元组。"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "偶对", "context": "由这样的偶对构造商。"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "指由给定偶对得到的商。"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指反向构造所取的元素。"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "偶对", "context": "反向构造得到前述类型的偶对。"}, {"source_term": "free module", "target_term": "自由模", "context": "指定标准生成截面所属的模。"}, {"source_term": "generating sections", "target_term": "生成截面", "context": "指生成该自由模的标准截面。"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "指两个变换互逆。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指两个变换所联系的函子。"}, {"source_term": "transformations", "target_term": "变换", "context": "指由两种构造给出的函子间变换。"}], "notes": []}
